      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f36b82c9ec59c0d1272ffe2|full_name}: Sooo I found out I accidentally was setting \"_UdonIsAudioOrbs\" to 1 in Update(). When putting it in Start() where it should have been, the value gets correctly reset. So it seems that the value is just getting reset too early in the leaving process.\nI'm guessing the reason it still reset for you eventually was likely because you world hopped again, causing vrchat to clear any world-set shader globals.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
