  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-30T21:52:58.266Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There's currently no code which reset the values of global variables once the user leaves the world that the variables were assigned in.\nThe expected behaviour is that the global variables, declared in a world, should be reset as soon as the user leaves it. Since the variables aren't currently reset, it means that they're accessible in other worlds, for example.\nIf this behaviour is intended, disregard this canny.\nHow to reproduce the issue:\n1. Write an Udon program which sets a global variable.\n2. Load into the world and have the Udon program set the global variable.\n3. Go to any other world.",
